Ehh, so cute!

5886
04:56:48,555 --> 04:56:51,055
かわいい！じゃ、帰ろ帰ろ！こっちだこっちだ、イナ！
So cute! Let's head home! This way, this way, Ina!

5887
04:56:51,055 --> 04:56:52,855
それで帰ろ！
Let's head back like that!

5888
