あ、なんかすごい集めてるじゃん。
Ah, you collected a whole lot!

5965
05:00:43,276 --> 05:00:44,276
よいしょ。
All right.

5966
05:00:44,276 --> 05:00:46,276
Today was a struggle,

5967
